ha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/deployments","created_at":"2012-12-07T13:30:23Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T11:48:01Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-11T20:11:30Z","git_url":"git://github.com/python/mypy.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:python/mypy.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/python/mypy.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/python/mypy","homepage":"https://www.mypy-lang.org/","size":77161,"stargazers_count":20064,"watchers_count":20064,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":3065,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":3124,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["linter","python","typechecker","types","typing"],"visibility":"public","forks":3065,"open_issues":3124,"watchers":20064,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Sorry if this has been brought up somewhere before, or I have overlooked some guidelines before posting this: I cannot manage to cope with typing when the value is contained in an **inline if statement** (what I think of as a ternary operator). I'm not sure if the case is limited to user-defined types or object types (I assume the built-in ones are not affected, but I have not yet tested) in general.\r\n\r\nConsider the following code:\r\n```python\r\ndef time_exec(f: Callable[[X], Y], *args: X) -> Tuple[Y, float]:\r\n    start = time.time()\r\n    res = f(*args)\r\n    end = time.time()\r\n    return res, end - start\r\n\r\ndef test_impls(\r\n    f1: Callable[[X], Y],\r\n    f2: Callable[[X], Y],\r\n    *input: X\r\n    ) -> Union[bool,Callable[[X], Y]]:\r\n\r\n    # The following code raises this error message:\r\n    # 'Incompatible return value type (got \"object\", expected \"Union[bool, Callable[[X], Y]]\")'\r\n    return sorted({\r\n        time_exec(f1, *input)[1]: f1,\r\n        time_exec(f2, *input)[1]: f2,\r\n        }.items())[0][1] if f1(*input) == f2(*input) else False\r\n```\r\nBut once rewritten in block code it gets pass the type check just fine:\r\n```python\r\ndef test_impls_block(\r\n    f1: Callable[[X], Y],\r\n    f2: Callable[[X], Y],\r\n    *input: X\r\n    ) -> Union[bool,Callable[[X], Y]]:\r\n\r\n    # logically equivalent to the above variant\r\n    dic = {\r\n        time_exec(f1, *input)[1]: f1,\r\n        time_exec(f2, *input)[1]: f2,\r\n        }\r\n    if f1(*input) == f2(*input):\r\n        if list(dic)[0] <= list(dic)[1]:\r\n            return f1\r\n        else:\r\n            return f2\r\n    else:\r\n        return False\r\n```\r\nI'm very new to the Python language and am generally little experienced in programming. Please kindly point out if I have missed something obvious. Thanks in advance.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/2470/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/2470/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":927936982,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDkyNzkzNjk4Mg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/events/927936982","actor":{"login":"JukkaL","id":1107911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDc5MTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1107911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL","html_url":"https://github.com/JukkaL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2017-01-18T18:38:34Z","label":{"name":"priority-1-normal","color":"fef2c0"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":927936984,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDkyNzkzNjk4NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/events/927936984","actor":{"login":"JukkaL","id":1107911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDc5MTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1107911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL","html_url